            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "AnnieM"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this frittata for brunch, or lunch, or even a light weeknight dinner. I added some extra spices, but the most valuable ingredient I chose was a fresh salsa from my supermarket. It incorporates fresh tomato, onion, cilantro, and jalapeño, so you can cut back in those ingredients, if you like. Among the spices I added are cumin, Mexican oregano, and cayenne."
          },
